public class MonthlyAttendanceAnnouncer { static class GymMember{String displayInfo(){return "Standard | Sessions: 0";}}static class PremiumMember extends GymMember{String trainer;PremiumMember(String t){trainer=t;}String displayInfo(){return "Premium | Trainer: "+trainer+" | Sessions: 0";}}static String batchPrint(GymMember[] x){StringBuilder b=new StringBuilder();for(GymMember m:x){b.append(m.displayInfo());if(m instanceof PremiumMember)b.append(" [Trainer via downcast: ").append(((PremiumMember)m).trainer).append("]");b.append(" | ");}return b.toString();}public static void main(String[]a){System.out.println(batchPrint(new GymMember[]{new GymMember(),new PremiumMember("Coach Riya")}));} }
